flowchart TB
  %% Airbnb-like high-level architecture: layered for interview readability.
  subgraph EdgeLayer[1. Users & Edge]
    direction LR
    Users[Guests / Hosts] --> DNS[Global DNS + CDN / WAF]
    DNS --> Web[Responsive Web Frontend<br/>SSR + static assets]
  end

  subgraph AppLayer[2. Application Layer]
    direction LR
    BFF[API Gateway / BFF<br/>Auth · rate limits · routing]
    Identity[Identity & Profile Service]
    Listing[Listing & Inventory Service]
    Booking[Booking / Pricing Service]
    SearchAPI[Search API]
    BFF --> Identity
    BFF --> Listing
    BFF --> Booking
    BFF --> SearchAPI
  end

  subgraph DataLayer[3. Data Layer]
    direction LR
    SQL[(Distributed Relational DB<br/>service-owned schemas · replicas)]
    Cache[(Distributed Cache)]
    Object[(Object Storage<br/>images · lifecycle tiers)]
  end

  subgraph AsyncLayer[4. Async Layer — eventually consistent]
    direction LR
    Bus[Event Bus / Queues]
    Indexer[Async Indexing Workers]
    Search[(Search Cluster<br/>geo · facets · ranking)]
    Analytics[Warehouse / Analytics]
    Bus --> Indexer
    Indexer --> Search
    Bus --> Analytics
  end

  subgraph ExternalLayer[5. External Services]
    direction LR
    Payments[Payment Provider]
    ImageCDN[Image CDN / Transforms]
  end

  subgraph ObservabilityLayer[6. Observability]
    direction LR
    Obs[Logs · Metrics · Traces · Alerts]
  end

  subgraph DeliveryLayer[CI/CD deployment infrastructure]
    direction LR
    Repo[Private Source Control] --> CI[CI/CD<br/>lint · tests · build · scan]
    CI --> Images[Versioned Container Images]
    CI --> Assets[Hashed Static Assets]
    Images --> Runtime[Multi-zone Container Platform<br/>autoscale · rolling deploys]
  end

  %% Primary request path.
  Web --> BFF
  SearchAPI --> Search
  SearchAPI --> Cache
  Identity --> SQL
  Listing --> SQL
  Booking --> SQL
  Listing --> Cache
  Listing --> Object
  Object --> ImageCDN

  %% Critical booking flow: strong consistency and transactional protection.
  Booking -->|availability check| Listing
  Listing -->|transaction + row lock| SQL
  SQL -->|commit succeeds| Payments
  Payments -->|payment result| Confirm[Booking confirmation]
  Booking -. booking event .-> Bus

  %% Critical indexing flow: asynchronous and eventually consistent.
  Listing -->|listing changed event| Bus

  %% Supporting event publication.
  Identity -. profile event .-> Bus

  %% Delivery wiring kept intentionally minimal.
  Assets -. deploy static assets .-> DNS
  Runtime -. deploy services .-> BFF

  %% Observability is a non-functional signal, not a business-data dependency.
  BFF -. telemetry .-> Obs
  Bus -. telemetry .-> Obs
  Runtime -. deploy health .-> Obs

